{"id":"steam-991700","steam":991700,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"噬魂围猎","summary":"《HUNT SOULEATER》is a PvPvE asymmetric competitive game. Here, you can play the role of a boss, leading a group of small monsters to ravage humans, or you can play the role of a hunter with powerful skills, forming a four player tactical team to fight against the boss and complete tasks.","about":"《HUNT SOULEATER》 is a PVPVE asymmetric competitive game that 5-30 players are divided into two camps: the hunters and the souleaters.\r\n\nSouleaters\n\r\nSouleaters have super power, and They act alone. In the time 6:00-18:00, they will change to hunters untill the soul binding stones are destroied. If they kill all the hunters or fight over two days, they win. \r\n\nhunters\n\r\n4 hunters form a teams. Every hunter has unique and powerful skills, and their tasks are destroy the soul binding stones and the temple on the Stramon Island where they should gather suplies、kill souleaters and monsters for survival. Hunters must finish the tasks in two days.\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Stramon Island. Become a highly anticipated hero in the new generation of tactical competitive games!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/library_600x900.jpg?t=1705333002","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/header.jpg?t=1705333002","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/library_hero.jpg?t=1705333002","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/header.jpg?t=1705333002","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1705333002","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991700/ss_1b1e7519e49089271c6039156046a2055246f10c.600x338.jpg?t=1705333002","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps